# Mobile-first web app

- Develop using React + TypeScript in Google AI Studio.
- Make it installable on Android as a PWA.
- Use Firebase for accounts and project data.
- Use browser-based AI inference for the first working background-removal engine.
- Add a server-hosted AI model when you have access to suitable compute.
- Later, create a native Android version if needed.

This gives you a real backend and a powerful editing interface without maintaining two separate applications from the beginning.

