Engine A: MediaPipe Selfie Segmentation

Free-start / on-device

- Detect people.
- Separate person and background.
- Run locally on the phone.
- Use additional hair segmentation for refinement.

[Make a Transparent Background PNG — PixEdit Blog | PixEdit](https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Nkp_xRmvDzLkhYOPegHdDTKdEAfHoKxIshbgfmi75NSPWUWjWwYy_zDdH3jrbtL8-PZlls-PgyTBIrTarY8Efb0aOhBJ7ji2f1m9JaNyTFMeGj050SIMbh7DlS-FYaTeOkgiLyQimlT5uvSA4Myy8Ks-erJJ4AndR2az9tYlm7M?purpose=inline)

Engine B: Interactive object segmentation

- Select an object by tapping or drawing a stroke.
- Generate an object mask.
- Allow adding and removing selected areas.
- Support product and general-object workflows.

MediaPipe provides dedicated person, hair and multi-class segmentation models. Its interactive segmentation task also supports selecting an object using user-provided points or strokes.&#x20;

